OL,3,GNEWSANew city centre blood donation
OL,4,Afacility approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to create a dedicated blood
OL,7,Fdonation centre in a city centre have
OL,8,Fbeen approved.
OL,10,FSunderland City Council has given the
OL,11,Fgreen light for the development of the
OL,12,Fground floor of the Faber building.
OL,14,FThe centre aims to collect donations
OL,15,Ffrom dozens of donors a day to collect
OL,16,Fthe vital blood components needed for
OL,17,Flife-saving treatments.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
